<% content_for :title, "MVP Development for Startups | ClientFirst Labs" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "ClientFirst Labs builds production-ready MVPs for early-stage startups. Go from idea to launch fast: scoped to validate, built to scale. Book a free founder call." %>

<section class="flex items-center justify-center min-h-[60vh] px-4 py-20 bg-background-navy md:px-8">
  <div class="w-full content-container">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <div class="mb-6 pill w-fit">
        <p>MVP Development</p>
      </div>
      <h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">MVP Development for Startups</h1>
      <p class="mb-8 text-lg text-white/80">Go from idea to a production-ready MVP without wasted time or over-engineered architecture. We scope, build, and ship around what you need to validate. Fast.</p>
      <div class="flex justify-start mt-8"><%= link_to "Book a Founder Strategy Call", "https://calendly.com/clientfirst-labs/discovery", class: "btn-primary btn-lg hover:text-gray-800" %></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-black md:px-8">
  <div class="content-container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 w-full sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-2 text-3xl font-bold text-secondary">8–16</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Weeks to Launch</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">Most MVPs ship in 8–16 weeks. We scope to your validation goal, not an imaginary feature list.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-2 text-3xl font-bold text-secondary">No</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Outsourcing</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">Senior engineers build your product directly. No handoffs to junior contractors or offshore teams.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-2 text-3xl font-bold text-secondary">Fixed</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Scope Pricing</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">You know what you're getting before we start. No surprise invoices, no runaway billing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-navy md:px-8">
  <div class="content-container">
    <div class="grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-6 pill w-fit">
          <p>Who this is for</p>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-white">Builder founders who need to ship</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-white/80">You have a validated idea (or you're close) and you need a technical partner to bring it to life. You're not looking for a dev shop that takes a brief and disappears. You need someone who thinks about your product like a co-founder.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-white/80">
          <li>→ Pre-seed and seed stage founders</li>
          <li>→ Non-technical or semi-technical founders</li>
          <li>→ Teams that need to show traction to investors</li>
          <li>→ Founders replacing manual workflows with software</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="mb-6 pill w-fit">
          <p>What we build</p>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-white">Production-ready MVPs, not prototypes</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-white/80">We build software you can actually sell, demo, and scale. Not throwaway prototypes. Every MVP is scoped around your validation goal and built with a foundation that grows with your product.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-white/80">
          <li>→ SaaS web applications</li>
          <li>→ Internal tools and dashboards</li>
          <li>→ Customer-facing platforms</li>
          <li>→ API integrations and automation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-black md:px-8">
  <div class="content-container">
    <div class="mx-auto mb-16 pill w-fit">
      <p>Our process</p>
    </div>
    <h2 class="mb-12 text-2xl font-bold text-center text-white sm:text-3xl">How MVP development works</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 w-full sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-secondary">01</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold text-white">Discovery Call</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">We learn your product, users, and goals. No sales pitch. Just an honest conversation about whether we're the right fit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-secondary">02</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold text-white">Scoping & Estimate</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">We scope the MVP around your validation goal and give you a fixed-price estimate with a realistic timeline.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-secondary">03</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold text-white">Build & Iterate</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">Weekly demos, tight feedback loops, and iterative delivery. You see progress throughout, not just at the end.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-secondary">04</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold text-white">Launch</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">We ship to production and hand off a codebase you own: clean, documented, and built to grow.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-navy md:px-8">
  <div class="content-container">
    <div class="mx-auto mb-12 pill w-fit">
      <p>Real outcome</p>
    </div>
    <h2 class="mb-8 text-2xl font-bold text-center text-white sm:text-3xl">See it in action</h2>
    <div class="p-8 mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-xl bg-white/5">
      <p class="mb-4 text-white/80">We helped Aspire, a Canadian InsurTech startup, go from manual operations to a full automation platform, eliminating 90% of manual work and unlocking $1M+ in revenue per agent.</p>
      <%= link_to "Read the Aspire case study →", aspire_case_studies_path, class: "text-primary font-medium" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-black md:px-8">
  <div class="content-container">
    <div class="mx-auto mb-8 pill w-fit">
      <p>Related services</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="p-6 text-center rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-3 font-semibold text-white">Prototype to Production</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-white/70">Already have an early build? We clean it up and get it production-ready.</p>
        <%= link_to "Learn more →", prototype_to_production_path, class: "text-primary text-sm font-medium" %>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 text-center rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-3 font-semibold text-white">Startup Product Development</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-white/70">Long-term product development partnership for scaling startups.</p>
        <%= link_to "Learn more →", startup_product_development_path, class: "text-primary text-sm font-medium" %>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 text-center rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-3 font-semibold text-white">AI & Automation</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-white/70">Add AI-powered features and workflows to your startup product.</p>
        <%= link_to "Learn more →", ai_automation_path, class: "text-primary text-sm font-medium" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-navy md:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center content-container">
    <h2 class="mb-4 max-w-xl text-2xl font-bold text-center text-white sm:text-3xl">Ready to build your MVP?</h2>
    <p class="mb-8 max-w-lg text-base text-center text-white/80">Book a free 30-minute strategy call. We'll talk through your idea, your stage, and what it would take to ship.</p>
    <%= link_to "Book a Founder Strategy Call", "https://calendly.com/clientfirst-labs/discovery", class: "btn-primary btn-lg hover:text-gray-800" %>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-white/50">Or <%= link_to "go back to the homepage", root_path, class: "text-primary" %> · <%= link_to "read the blog", blog_path, class: "text-primary" %></p>
  </div>
</section>
